---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Mohammed Fawaz — About">
  <header class="masthead">
    <h1>MOHAMMED FAWAZ</h1>
    <p>Robotics and Automation Engineering</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h2 id="about-heading">About Me</h2>
    <p>I am a Robotics and Automation Engineering undergraduate at Sahyadri College of Engineering and Management, with graduation expected in October 2026. My work combines mechanical design with embedded control and computer vision.</p>
    <p>During my R&amp;D internship at AIRAT Systems LLP in Karnataka from January to June 2026, I worked on a desktop animatronic robot and the ArecaSort V1 grading machine. For the robot, I developed the mechanical structure from an open-source model, designed the base and housing in SolidWorks and Fusion 360, and configured Raspberry Pi 4 and NVIDIA Jetson hardware. I developed multithreaded Python software for face tracking, speech-to-text processing, and servo control.</p>
    <p>For ArecaSort V1, I led the initial mechanical design and prepared a dataset covering four arecanut quality grades. I evaluated vision models, optimised YOLOv10 with TensorRT FP16, and tested the mechanical sorting mechanism using Raspberry Pi 5.</p>
    <p>My academic work includes leading a team developing a fish sorting and grading system, building a three-joint robotic manipulator, and implementing PD control on a line-following robot. I am seeking opportunities in robotics, manufacturing, automation, and R&amp;D where I can contribute to design, integration, and testing.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
    <h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
    <p><strong>Bachelor of Engineering in Robotics &amp; Automation</strong><br />Sahyadri College of Engineering and Management<br />August 2022 – October 2026 (expected)<br />Cumulative GPA: 3.5/4</p>
  </section>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
    <h2 id="skills-heading">Technical Skills</h2>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Mechanical and hardware</dt><dd>SolidWorks, Fusion 360, Onshape, Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and NVIDIA Jetson.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Programming and systems</dt><dd>Python, C++, Linux, and Git.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Robotics and simulation</dt><dd>ROS 2, Gazebo, CoppeliaSim, MATLAB, and RoboAnalyzer.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Computer vision</dt><dd>OpenCV, YOLOv8, YOLOv10, Roboflow, and TensorRT.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Additional tools</dt><dd>LangChain, n8n, and PLC.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <a class="project-link" href="/projects">View engineering projects →</a>
  </section>

